\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces One Grover iteration of QDOA at the hardware-empirical optimum $k{=}1$ (dashed box). The oracle $O_{\mathcal  {M}}$ marks the grammar-valid set $\mathcal  {M}$ and the diffusion $D$ reflects about the mean; both act on the data register and the $n{-}2$ clean ancillas, which they share through a v-chain multi-controlled-$Z$ (oracle: $X$-mask, MCZ, $X$-mask; diffusion: $H^{\otimes n}$, $X^{\otimes n}$, MCZ, $X^{\otimes n}$, $H^{\otimes n}$), each costing $6(n{-}2)$ two-qubit gates (Table~\ref {tab:gatecost}). The ancillas are returned to $\ensuremath  {|0\rangle }$. Measuring the data register gives the sampled distribution $\{p_i\}$ whose arg-max is the segmentation index $x^{\ast }$.}}{4}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:circuit}{{1}{4}{One Grover iteration of QDOA at the hardware-empirical optimum $k{=}1$ (dashed box). The oracle $O_{\mathcal {M}}$ marks the grammar-valid set $\mathcal {M}$ and the diffusion $D$ reflects about the mean; both act on the data register and the $n{-}2$ clean ancillas, which they share through a v-chain multi-controlled-$Z$ (oracle: $X$-mask, MCZ, $X$-mask; diffusion: $H^{\otimes n}$, $X^{\otimes n}$, MCZ, $X^{\otimes n}$, $H^{\otimes n}$), each costing $6(n{-}2)$ two-qubit gates (Table~\ref {tab:gatecost}). The ancillas are returned to $\ket {0}$. Measuring the data register gives the sampled distribution $\{p_i\}$ whose arg-max is the segmentation index $x^{\ast }$}{figure.1}{}}
