\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Top-1 accuracy over $K{=}20$ independent PQC trainings (boxes: quartiles; whiskers: range; dots: outliers). The classical baseline (dashed) is deterministic. The noiseless (ideal) and NISQ distributions largely overlap, confirming the spread is training-driven rather than noise-driven.}}{5}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:accuracy}{{3}{5}{Top-1 accuracy over $K{=}20$ independent PQC trainings (boxes: quartiles; whiskers: range; dots: outliers). The classical baseline (dashed) is deterministic. The noiseless (ideal) and NISQ distributions largely overlap, confirming the spread is training-driven rather than noise-driven}{figure.3}{}}
