\newlabel{fig:scaling}{{4}{6}{Projected oracle queries per word under $\bigO (N)$ (classical) and $\bigO (\sqrtN )$ (quantum), from the measured $n{=}4$ baseline. The query-complexity crossover is at $n{=}8$; below the noise wall ($n\!\ge \!11$ for a single marked state) this crossover is not yet realisable end-to-end on current hardware}{figure.4}{}}
